 "summary_en": "Two things are visibly running. Tyks takes part in the national low-dose CT lung cancer screening pilot that started in January 2026, open to long-term smokers aged 50–74 in Southwest Finland and including help to stop smoking. Tyks has also centralised lung cancer diagnostics at its pulmonary outpatient clinic, publishes a care pathway, and has a multidisciplinary team plan treatment. I found no decisions from the county board or council, no investments and no published waiting-time figures specific to lung cancer.",
 "not_found_en": "I found no Varha board or council decisions, investments, waiting-time figures, nurse navigator or radiotherapy plans for lung cancer, and the FICAN page on Varha's own screening invitations timed out both times.",
